sequenceDiagram
    participant V as Victim browser
    participant B as bank.com
    participant E as evil.com
    V->>B: Log in, receives session cookie
    V->>E: Visits malicious page
    E-->>V: Hidden form targeting bank.com
    V->>B: POST /transfer plus cookie (auto-attached)
    alt No defense
        B-->>V: Transfer executed
    else CSRF token or SameSite cookie
        B-->>V: 403 rejected
    end
